<SiteLayout title="Khmer Seller Book" description="Planned Kroma Digital app for Facebook and TikTok sellers in Cambodia.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Kroma Digital App</span><h1>Khmer Seller Book</h1><p>A lightweight seller operations tool for tracking sales, profit, payments, and deliveries.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><article class="card"><span class="tag">In planning</span><h2>What it is for</h2><p>Khmer Seller Book is designed for small sellers who currently manage orders and payments through chat, notes, or spreadsheets and need a clearer daily view.</p><h3>Planned features</h3><ul><li>Sales and order records</li><li>Basic profit visibility</li><li>Unpaid or partially paid orders</li><li>Delivery status tracking</li><li>Simple product and customer records</li></ul></article><article class="card"><h2>Development status</h2><p>This product is currently in planning and validation. Features, pricing, screenshots, and release timing may change before launch.</p><h3>Privacy</h3><p>When the app enters testing or release, its data practices will be documented on the dedicated app privacy page.</p><a class="btn" href="/privacy/khmer-seller-book">View app privacy page</a></article></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>